    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752730313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752730313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1752730313\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/7acc2683264726100dadc6259dccdace.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/7df54c305f341d95a5fa8dc8157afbda.webp?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Since ancient times, there have been dark beings, demons, that harbor grudges against humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in modern times, they still exist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However... there are also those who protect people from these demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are called &quot;exorcists&quot; and have been battling demons since ancient times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current head of the prestigious exorcist family, the Kuranashi (Dark Void) family, is &quot;Kuranashi Mari.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Mari rescues a girl named &quot;Aikawa Hiyori&quot; who was attacked by demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help Hiyori, who has lost her exorcist powers due to a womb tattoo, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari dedicates herself to the battle against the demons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/97ef45c0096b0bcfe3b6e04865f22b63.webp?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/545cb0c3a835c924505bb2bdad6da70e.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=380 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/86fe3c59eca8c4827ddda6fc0d786188.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=380 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/f1d0f80eb62bf048efc86934016317fa.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=380 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/8f7e4f3ad1573943ab1862c36c04483b.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/b185aef474dff0c10588eebc8ce342ee.webp?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=60 /></span>This is a classic turn-based RPG with a command-style interface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design is straightforward even for RPG beginners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbDefeat Scenes (H-Scenes)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/5493fae23d2291d7a1a10da6034f1e8c.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=200 /></span>If Mari's health points (HP) reach zero in battle, she is defeated,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and will be raped by her opponent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher Mari's Ero level is, the more explicit and debauched Mari becomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, in some scenes, specific Debuffs will lead to unique variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEvent Scenes (H-Events)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/2cc6839e4d0d51f2c59062b0310a7990.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=200 /></span>During map exploration, choosing certain options highlighted in pink may lead to &quot;H Events&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where Mari is either forced or asked to do lewd things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These scenes primarily involve interactions with humans, and similar to defeat scenes, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the higher Mari's Ero level is, the more explicit her actions become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar to defeat scenes, some events may have unique variations based on specific debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, if Mari's Ero level reaches the maximum of 3, additional scenes may occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbCombat H</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/ea5ddc92d47ad0611884f436cc07d6b0.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=200 /></span>During combat, attacks from demons have a chance of breaking Mari's armor,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and once demons use H attack after that, &quot;Combat H&quot; will be triggered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When receiving H attack, Mari's Energy(EP) will be absorbed by demons, and her Ecstasy and Ero level will increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, in some combat H, specific Debuffs will lead to unique variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEcstasy System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When receiving H attack in combat, &quot;Ecstasy&quot; will increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Ecstasy reaches 100, Mari cums and becomes unable to move for one turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, her energy will be replenished, and her Max EP, ATK, and SP(Sorcery ATK) will increase by 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbLust System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/92062ea360b78236da9f70727a917f4e.avif?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=200 /></span>When receiving H attacks, being raped after defeated, and doing lewd things in Events,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mari's &quot;Lust&quot; will increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Lust is at a certain degree, &quot;Ero Level&quot; will increase, and Mari's reaction in H Scenes will change correspondingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbDebuff System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the demons, some can apply Debuffs on Mari.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When receiving these attacks, Debuffs such as &quot;Lactating&quot; or &quot;Infested&quot; might be applied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Debuffs will not only put Mari at a disadvantage in combat, but also trigger specific H Scenes that have unique variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799920/extras/fc78901d1c4563752617d056c983579a.webp?t=1752730313\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate with either mouse or keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressing the shift key during battle activates auto-battle. Pressing it again reverts the command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ero Status and Memory Room are also available.</p></li></ul>",
